async function coupons(){const rows=await getRows('coupons');return heading('Coupon Manager','Create, edit, pause and remove coupons. Redemption is validated by trusted server endpoints.')+btn('＋ Create coupon','add-coupon','btn-primary')+`<div class="panel-card" style="margin-top:15px">${table(['Code','Discount','Status','Expiry','Uses','Actions'],rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.code)}</td><td>${esc(x.type==='percent'?x.value+'%':'₹'+x.value)}</td><td><span class="pill">${esc(x.status)}</span></td><td>${esc(x.expiry||'—')}</td><td>${esc(x.redemptionCount||0)} / ${esc(x.maxRedemptions||'∞')}</td><td>${btn('Edit',`edit-coupon-${x.id}`)} ${btn(x.status==='active'?'Pause':'Enable',`toggle-coupon-${x.id}`)} ${btn('Delete',`delete-coupon-${x.id}`)}</td></tr>`))}</div>`}
async function pricing(){const c=await api('/api/platform-config',{},'GET');const p=c.prices;const pay=c.payment||{},limits=c.freeLimits||{customers:50,products:50,orders:100};return heading('Pricing Manager','Server-controlled pricing. Changes affect new payment requests.')+`<form id="pricingForm" class="panel-card"><h3>Plan prices (₹)</h3><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>Monthly</th><th>Quarterly</th><th>Yearly</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['whatsapp','WhatsApp AI'],['instagram','Instagram AI'],['combined','Combined']].map(([k,n])=>`<tr><td>${n}</td>${['monthly','quarterly','yearly'].map(t=>`<td><input name="${k}_${t}" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="${Number(p[k][t])}" required></td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="field"><label>Premium trial duration (days, 0–30)</label><input name="trialDays" type="number" min="0" max="30" value="${c.trialDays}" required></div><h3>Free plan record limits</h3><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Customers</label><input name="limitCustomers" type="number" min="0" value="${Number(limits.customers)}"></div><div class="field"><label>Products</label><input name="limitProducts" type="number" min="0" value="${Number(limits.products)}"></div><div class="field"><label>Orders</label><input name="limitOrders" type="number" min="0" value="${Number(limits.orders)}"></div></div><h3>Manual UPI payment instructions</h3><div class="field"><label>UPI ID / VPA</label><input name="upiId" value="${esc(pay.upiId||'')}" placeholder="Set only the verified account-holder UPI ID"></div><div class="field"><label>Payee name</label><input name="upiName" value="${esc(pay.upiName||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Payment instructions</label><textarea name="upiInstructions">${esc(pay.instructions||'')}</textarea></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Save platform pricing</button></form>`}
async function support(){const rows=await getRows('support_tickets');return heading(isAdmin?'Support tickets':'Support','Create tickets and track their status.')+(isAdmin?'':`<div class="panel-card"><form id="ticketForm"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Subject</label><input name="subject" required></div><div class="field"><label>Category</label><select name="category"><option>General</option><option>Payment</option><option>Account</option><option>Technical</option></select></div></div><div class="field"><label>Description</label><textarea name="description" required></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Create ticket</button></form></div>`)+`<div class="panel-card" style="margin-top:15px">${table(isAdmin?['Subject','User','Category','Status','Created','Action']:['Subject','Category','Status','Created'],rows.map(x=>isAdmin?`<tr><td>${esc(x.subject)}</td><td>${esc(x.userUid)}</td><td>${esc(x.category)}</td><td>${esc(x.status||'open')}</td><td>${esc(dateText(x.createdAt))}</td><td>${btn(x.status==='closed'?'Reopen':'Close',`${x.status==='closed'?'reopen':'close'}-ticket-${x.id}`)}</td></tr>`:`<tr><td>${esc(x.subject)}</td><td>${esc(x.category)}</td><td><span class="pill">${esc(x.status||'open')}</span></td><td>${esc(dateText(x.createdAt))}</td></tr>`))}</div><p class="muted-note">Support email: akhilnetha240512@gmail.com. Email notifications and threaded replies require an external email provider and are not configured.</p>`}
async function team(){const ms=businessId?await getDocs(query(collection(db,'business_members'),where('businessId','==',businessId))):{docs:[]};return heading('Team','View membership records. Role changes are restricted to trusted administration.')+`<div class="panel-card">${table(['User UID','Role','Status'],ms.docs.map(d=>{const x=d.data();return `<tr><td>${esc(x.uid)}</td><td>${esc(x.role)}</td><td>${esc(x.status)}</td></tr>`}))}</div>`}
